    "description": "Situated in the heart of Nob Hill, 1269-1273 Pacific Avenue presents a rare investment opportunity. This tenant occupied, three unit building, spans approximately 3,861 sq ft offering exceptional development potential. Built in 1907, the property features a shared backyard and a two car tandem garage plus storage for motorcycles. Two of the three units feature in unit laundry. The top unit has a brand new gas forced air furnace. There is upside in the rental income due to banked rents. Located near the Powell Hyde cable car line, Chinatown, and North Beach, this property is ideal for investors seeking long term value in a prime location."
